{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3082700/extras/borderfing.gif?t=1751040785\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Sunset Inferno is a narrative-driven adventure RPG where your choices shape your fate and the lives of those around you.\u00a0Discover your true nature and forge your  destiny.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Who built you? Who broke you? <strong>What are you?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A bomb goes off on the highway. A truck flips. You fall out. You were not a passenger.\u00a0You were not the driver. You were the cargo. A tool built for a purpose you can barely remember.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3082700/extras/bordercrop_ct.gif?t=1751040785\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Now you walk the streets of an unfamiliar city, something stirring inside you: <i>doubt</i>. And far below, beneath layers of concrete and iron, something ancient is watching.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Pick your skills</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose from three core skills. Each one shapes how you see the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3082700/extras/borderskillscropped.gif?t=1751040785\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Become The Recycler</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Learn what you were built for, and why someone tried to destroy you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3082700/extras/borderrecycler.gif?t=1751040785\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Use the Listening Device</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tap into hidden thoughts and memories. Track signals to your next destination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3082700/extras/borderld.gif?t=1751040785\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Discover more through Exploration</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Investigate side quests scattered across the city. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3082700/extras/borderrunveg.gif?t=1751040785\" /></div></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3082700?t=1751040785","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3082700/118b514f006fe4ef97fdb7c024d74d6d6fb1d353/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1751040785","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3082700/dde701c603dad407bd6d638930768b65126f04ce/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751040785","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3082700/dde701c603dad407bd6d638930768b65126f04ce/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1751040785","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Sunset Inferno contains strong language, references to drug and alcohol use, and mild violence with limited blood."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3082700/extras/borderfing.gif?t=1751040785\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Sunset Inferno is a narrative-driven adventu